* {{ru-IPA|phon=бох}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-бог.ogg}}
* {{ru-IPA}} {{q|rare|proscribed}}
* In the nominative singular, the word is usually pronounced {{IPAchar|/box/}} due to Church Slavonic influence. The regular pronunciation {{IPAchar|/bok/}} is used only rarely (mostly for pagan deities) and is not recommended. In all other case forms, the regular {{IPAchar|/ɡ/}} is now more common, though {{IPAchar|/ɣ/}} was formerly used.

